<cap:headline>River Bagmati at Benibad in Muzaffarpur district of Bihar continues to flow in above normal flood situation at 6:00 pm today.</cap:headline>
<cap:description>River Bagmati at Benibad in Muzaffarpur district of Bihar continues to flow in above normal flood situation at 6:00 pm today. At 6:00 pm, it was flowing at a level of 48.06 m with falling trend which is 0.38 m above its Warning Level of 47.68 m and 0.62 m below its Danger Level of 48.68 m.</cap:description>
